# Qualitying

Static Astro 5 blog: `en` + `de` under `src/content/blog/{en,de}/`. Full guide: `AGENTS.md`.

## Posts

- Slug = filename without `.md`; prefer `YYMMDD-slug.md` like existing posts.
- Frontmatter: `title`, `description`, `pubDate`; optional `updatedDate`, `tags`, `draft`.
- `draft: true` shows in dev only; hidden in production builds.
- EN and DE posts are independent — do not auto-create a translation unless asked.
- German AI translations: use tag `ai translated`.

## Code

- UI strings → `src/i18n/ui.ts` (both languages).
- Post language from path: `en/foo` → lang `en`, slug `foo` (`src/utils/posts.ts`).
- Internal URLs → `withBase()` from `src/utils/url.ts`.
- Site: `astro.config.mjs`; domain in `public/CNAME`.

## Agent habits

- Minimal diffs; no commits unless the user asks.
- Run `npm run check` or `npm run build` after content schema or type changes.
